## Purpose

{{ description }}

This is a *durable* agent: runs survive crashes, redeploys{% if include_hitl %} and long human waits{% endif %}. Every model call and tool call is a checkpointed DBOS step; on restart DBOS re-runs the workflow function and completed steps return their recorded output instead of executing.

